{"unit_id": "tag:01M3:prose-0002", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n我们在《层（Sheaves）》第<REF_0001>节定义了基（basis）上的层（sheaf）的概念，并证明这一概念本质上等价（equivalent）于空间（space）上的层（sheaf）的概念，见《层（Sheaves）》引理<REF_0002>和<REF_0003>。此外，我们在《层（Sheaves）》引理<REF_0004>中证明，层条件（sheaf condition）对每个标准开集（standard open）只需在一个共尾（cofinal）的开覆盖（coverings）系上检验。由上面的引理，只需在由标准开集（standard opens）组成的有限（finite）覆盖（coverings）上检验。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "Sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "basis", "target_term": "基"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价"}, {"source_term": "space", "target_term": "空间"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "Sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "Sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "sheaf condition", "target_term": "层条件"}, {"source_term": "standard open", "target_term": "标准开集"}, {"source_term": "cofinal", "target_term": "共尾"}, {"source_term": "coverings", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "standard opens", "target_term": "标准开集"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}, {"source_term": "coverings", "target_term": "覆盖"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "Sheaves", "target_term": "层", "context": "所引章节的名称"}, {"source_term": "basis", "target_term": "基", "context": "定义层所依托的拓扑基"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "基上的层"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价", "context": "比较两种层的概念"}, {"source_term": "space", "target_term": "空间", "context": "另一种层所定义于其上的空间"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "空间上的层"}, {"source_term": "Sheaves", "target_term": "层", "context": "所引章节的名称"}, {"source_term": "Sheaves", "target_term": "层", "context": "所引章节的名称"}, {"source_term": "sheaf condition", "target_term": "层条件", "context": "需对覆盖检验的层条件"}, {"source_term": "standard open", "target_term": "标准开集", "context": "逐一检验层条件的对象"}, {"source_term": "cofinal", "target_term": "共尾", "context": "限定所检验的开覆盖系